<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
Thank you for contacting Specific Needs regarding your mobility aid.<br />
<br />
Qantas offers its customers three different levels of assistance, depending on the passenger’s requirements:
<ul>
	<li>Wheelchair to the departure gate</li>
	<li>Wheelchair to the door of the aircraft</li>
	<li>Wheelchair to the seat of the aircraft</li>
</ul>
Assistance can also be provided to passengers that have limited or no mobility to transfer from their own wheelchair to an aisle chair and to the aircraft seat.<br />
<br />
To ensure appropriate level of assistance is provided please complete the <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/travel-info/specific-needs/mobility-assistance/mobility-assistance-request-form.html">request mobility assistance</a> form.</body>
</html>